WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A small weight hangs from a thread. No hand pushes it.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Someone pictures a circle; the first movement is nearly invisible.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
The arc grows. The holder may sincerely feel they did nothing.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
An old question returns: can suggestion move a muscle without conscious choice?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Modern researchers measure motion and separate expectation from external forces.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The pendulum moved. Its explanation still requires evidence.
